<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Wanpot | Please Sign In</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
      color: #f8fafc;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #facc15;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 400px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .auth-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .login-btn {
      background-color: #facc15;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .login-btn:hover {
      background-color: #fde047;
    }

    .signup-btn {
      background-color: transparent;
      border: 1px solid #facc15;
      color: #facc15;
    }

    .signup-btn:hover {
      background-color: #facc15;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    footer {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="content">
    <h1>Welcome to Wanpot AI</h1>
    <p>
      It seems you’re not signed in yet.<br>
      Please sign up or log in to enjoy a seamless experience with Wanpot’s powerful features.
    </p>

    <div class="auth-buttons">
      <a href="/login" class="login-btn">Sign In</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="signup-btn">Sign Up</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Wanpot — All Rights Reserved</footer>
</body>
</html>
